{
	"_note": "The sound effects of the game (autoload Sfx, autoload/sfx.gd). groups: name -> {files, volume (dB), pitch (the random spread of the pitch), gap (seconds before the group may play again), use}. A group plays a different file each time (never the same twice in a row), with a little random pitch and volume, so the sounds that come up a lot do not get monotonous. The interface uses Kenney's Interface Sounds (CC0), each for what its name says (click, select, confirmation, back, close, open, switch, toggle, drop, error, tick, scroll...); the text uses the Unicae keyboard pack (free to use); the Response fight (groups r_...) uses the Beats Warrior Nian SFX pack. button_rules: which group a button makes (see autoload/sfx.gd). voices: the pitch of the typing of each speaker. Played on the SFX bus.",
